00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:40.353
So few words of introduction and welcome.

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:44.760
We don't have any apologies
today, which is great.

00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:47.220
It is David Probert's last meeting.

00:01:47.220 --> 00:01:49.050
So I'd particularly like
to say thank you, David,

00:01:49.050 --> 00:01:50.730
